              a: 'No. Under Budget 2024 tax rules, Long-Term Capital Gains (LTCG) on equity mutual funds held for more than 12 months are taxed at 12.5% on capital gains exceeding ₹1.25 lakh per financial year. Short-Term Capital Gains (STCG) on units held up to 12 months are taxed at 20%.',
            },
            {
              q: 'What is a Step-Up SIP?',
              a: 'A Step-Up (or Top-Up) SIP automatically increases your monthly installment amount periodically (typically 5% to 10% each year in line with annual salary increments). This accelerates corpus accumulation significantly over long investment horizons.',
            },
          ].map((item) => (
            <details class="border border-border rounded-card overflow-hidden bg-surface">
