        <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-surface border border-accent/30 rounded-card text-xs text-text-muted">
          <strong class="text-text-primary text-sm block mb-1">Comparing fixed deposits vs mutual fund SIPs?</strong>
          Read our in-depth analysis on <a href="/blog/rd-vs-sip" class="text-accent font-semibold hover:underline">RD vs. SIP: Guaranteed Returns vs. Market-Linked Wealth Creation &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 9. Authoritative Footer Review & Methodology -->
      <div class="border-t border-border pt-6 pb-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-text-muted gap-2">
        <div>
          <span>Last updated: <strong>September 2026</strong></span>
          <span class="mx-2">·</span>
          <span>Reviewed against statutory Indian financial modeling conventions</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a href="/methodology" class="hover:text-accent underline transition-standard">View formula methodology</a>
        </div>
